lages.\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":["25\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["The native ",{"tag":"a","children":["Ewoks"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Ewoks"}," are shamanistic, superstitious, and clever. They built their villages in the boughs of great trees and are known to build complex traps and pitfalls to snare much larger predators.\n"]}]}]}]},"\n","\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
